  "body": "This release adds parallel downloads and dynamic storefront discovery, and improves authentication and recovery of delisted apps.\r\n\r\n* Added parallel download streams for large app packages.\r\n* Added dynamic App Store storefront discovery to support regions missing from the built-in list.\r\n* Improved recovery of previously acquired, delisted iOS apps.\r\n* Improved sign-in errors by displaying Apple's authentication dialogs and links for required account actions.\r\n* Reduced memory usage and startup time, with faster initial setup.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/majd/ipatool/compare/v2.8.0...v2.8.1",
